# Panes - nvim (actions/nvim/nvim_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**        -- Pane Maximize
**panes + h**          -- Pane Left
**panes + l**          -- Pane Right
**panes + up**         -- Pane Above
**panes + j**          -- Pane Below
**panes + -**          -- Pane Horizontal Split
**panes + \**          -- Pane Vertical Split
**panes + w**          -- Close Pane
**panes + toggle**     -- Pane Toggle
**panes + resize + h** -- Pane Resize Left
**panes + resize + l** -- Pane Resize Right
**panes + resize + k** -- Pane Resize Above
**panes + resize + j** -- Pane Resize Below
